From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Add media intents and a minimalist remote layout editor

Expose play/pause and track skipping through the Tasker command receiver.
Let users assign and move buttons in the minimalist panel, and persist
its layout in the existing remote settings.

